        <item>
            <title>Version 1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>Following the first round of real-world testing,
                this release addresses the most-visible issues and
                adds a few small comforts.</p>

                <h3>Fixed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Apple Translation: re-arms on every click for any language pair.</li>
                    <li>MLX models: translation now advances past the first chunk.</li>
                    <li>MLX (translategemma family): no longer runs away with nonsense output — Gemma chat-template fallback and corrected stop-sequence detection.</li>
                    <li>Loading indicator: shows "Loading &lt;model&gt;…" with a live progress bar.</li>
                    <li>Window layout: bottom bar no longer overlaps the editors.</li>
                    <li>Models dropdown: installed MLX models appear on launch.</li>
                    <li>Ollama: silenced IPv6 console noise.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Added</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Clear button in the source pane (⌘⌫).</li>
                    <li>Review mode hides the continuous source pane and gives all three paragraph columns equal width.</li>
                    <li>Default window size bumped to 1280 × 820.</li>
                    <li>Translate button disabled during model loading.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
